## 🚀 How to Run the Project

### 1. Start the Backend API

From the project root:

```bash
cd backend
.venv/bin/python run.py
```

Or using uvicorn directly:

```bash
cd backend
.venv/bin/python -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000 --reload
```

The API will be live at:
- **API Base**: `http://127.0.0.1:8000`
- **Interactive Documentation**: `http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs`
- **Database Health**: `http://127.0.0.1:8000/health/db`

### 2. Start the Frontend

In a separate terminal, serve the frontend on port 5500:

```bash
cd ~/Downloads/full_stack_lab/assignment2
python3 -m http.server 5500
```

Open in your browser:
- `http://127.0.0.1:5500/html/index.html` (Home)
- `http://127.0.0.1:5500/html/products.html` (Shop)
- `http://127.0.0.1:5500/html/cart.html` (Cart & Checkout)
- `http://127.0.0.1:5500/html/signin.html` (Sign In)
- `http://127.0.0.1:5500/html/signup.html` (Create Account)
- `http://127.0.0.1:5500/html/profile.html` (Account & Orders)

